    "ratings": {
      "5": {
        "feel": "Okay",
        "skill": "Moderate",
        "issues": [],
        "notes": "you just have to hop up and down and not really move left and right. btw when i select moderate skill i just mean you can't just walk straight/only die on purpose. its actually really easy. \n\nto make it harder move hole which you can slip through randomly left or right, don't make it left middle right middle left middle right middle left middle right, make it randomly go between the 3, making sure that you don't have to move left or right twice in the same \"turn\". \n\nalso it should be possible in this new version that the left lane for example has the hole 2 times in a row, it doesn't always have to switch.\n\n\nNOTICE: i just noticed what i described is basically duck and dodge. we also need to dedupe sections/make variations intentional ",
        "updated": "2026-09-12T15:55:32.751Z"
      }
    }
